{"id":18959,"date":"2025-12-07T17:38:33","date_gmt":"2025-12-07T17:38:33","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/?page_id=18959"},"modified":"2025-12-07T17:38:33","modified_gmt":"2025-12-07T17:38:33","slug":"dj-fresh-jakeem","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/dj-fresh-jakeem\/","title":{"rendered":"DJ Fresh (Jakeem)"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><strong>Since 2012, DJ Fresh has been turning moments into memories.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft size-medium wp-image-18958\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/20250425_092617-225x300.jpg\" alt=\"A man wearing a black suit and tie, resembling the polished style of professional DJs, takes a mirror selfie in a tiled restroom while holding a smartphone.\" width=\"225\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/20250425_092617-225x300.jpg 225w, https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/20250425_092617-768x1024.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/20250425_092617-1152x1536.jpg 1152w, https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/20250425_092617-1536x2048.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/20250425_092617-scaled.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 225px) 100vw, 225px\" \/>Born and raised in Brooklyn, NY, Jakeem\u2014known professionally as\u00a0<strong>DJ Fresh<\/strong>\u2014brings over a decade of experience, unmatched musical versatility, and an infectious energy that elevates every event he touches. Whether he\u2019s entertaining a corporate crowd, celebrating with a mitzvah family, or packing the dance floor at a wedding, his focus is always the same:\u00a0<strong>deliver an unforgettable experience.<\/strong><\/p>\n<h3><strong>What drives DJ Fresh?<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p>From the moment he first stepped behind the decks, DJ Fresh was hooked by the art of mixing and the joy that radiates from a crowd when the perfect song hits.\u00a0<em>\u201cI love the reaction of enjoyment from the audience\u2014it\u2019s exhilarating.\u201d<\/em><\/p>\n<h3><strong>Signature Style<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p>In his headphones, you\u2019ll often find 90\u2019s and 2000\u2019s Hip-Hop &amp; R&amp;B, but his true superpower is blending\u00a0<strong>all genres<\/strong>\u2014Top 40, EDM, classics, Latin, Caribbean, pop, mitzvah favorites, and more\u2014seamlessly and with purpose.<\/p>\n<h3><strong>Dance Floor Expertise<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p>DJ Fresh feeds off the energy of the room, tailoring every set to its unique demographic. Some of his tried-and-true floor fillers include:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>\u201cSnap Yo Fingers\u201d \u2013 Lil Jon<\/strong><\/li>\n<li><strong>\u201cBe Faithful (Put Your Hands Up)\u201d \u2013 Fatman Scoop<\/strong><\/li>\n<li><strong>\u201cGive Me Everything\u201d \u2013 Pitbull<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>But above all, he reads the crowd in real time to deliver exactly what they need.<\/p>\n<h3><strong>Why Clients Love Him<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p>For corporate clients, he\u2019s polished, reliable, and knows how to set the right mood for everything from galas to brand activations.<br \/>\nFor mitzvah families, he brings hype, interaction, and fun\u2014while keeping it clean and family-friendly.<br \/>\nFor weddings, he creates a seamless soundtrack that reflects each couple\u2019s style and keeps the dance floor full all night.<\/p>\n<h3><strong>Outside the DJ Booth<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p>When he\u2019s not mixing music, DJ Fresh loves staying active and working out\u2014fueling the high-energy presence he\u2019s known for behind the turntables.<\/p>\n<h3><strong>The DJ Fresh Promise<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p><em>\u201cHello, I&#8217;m DJ Fresh. I specialize in blending all genres to create an electric atmosphere that keeps dance floors packed and guests fully engaged. My goal is simple: deliver unforgettable energy tailored to your 